<!--
  RM_Qorrax.xml                           RimMandrake — STILLSAND_BEDAZZLE_CONTENT_1

  The qorrax (renamed from JOE_Cephalope, Q7 ratified) moved INLINE into the RM
  mod (Q1): invented content, no Star Wars IP, so it no longer rides the Utinni
  patch route. Its defName is unchanged, so saves and every other biome's
  roster row (patched in by mandrake.rut.patches) still resolve.

  Self-contained: its own body (RM_QorraxBody, with its own shell part and
  tentacle groups), its own eggs, and its own copies of the renders in
  Textures/Things/Pawn/Animal/RM_Qorrax (grounded, dessicated, swimming).
  The donor-absorbed Cephaloid/Nautiloid bodies and Shell part stay in
  mandrake.rut.patches for the landopus and nautilant, which this does not touch.
-->
